sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CTC as CTC Office
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    CTC->>H: closed_blocks, SwitchCommand(line, switch, position)
    Note right of CTC: Switch commands are sent only in maintenance mode. There is no mode flag.
    H->>M: step(dt, ctc.closed_blocks, ctc.switch_commands)
    M->>M: maintenance := a command is in effect on a switch it governs
    loop each wayside
        opt maintenance changed
            M->>W: set_maintenance(active)
            Note right of W: Ending it releases every hand-set switch and CTC command.
        end
        M->>W: set_closed(block, closed) for each block
        M->>W: set_ctc_switch_command(switch, position or none)
    end
    Note right of W: The PLC sees CLOSED_n and MAINT. The vital code gives a closed block no authority and obeys the CTC's switch command.
